---
description: Stage 1 correctness-before-features harness
globs:
  - PLAN.md
  - GOAL.md
  - R/alignment_*.R
  - R/fit_alignment*.R
  - R/apply_alignment.R
  - R/compose.R
  - R/quality.R
  - R/shared_feature_space.R
  - tests/testthat/test-correctness-contracts.R
alwaysApply: false
---

Execute `PLAN.md` in order. `GOAL.md` is the completion contract.

- Work Stage 1 only. Do not start Stage 2/3/4.
- Do not add aligners or weaken tests to go green.
- Do not mark a PLAN.md box complete until the relevant test passed.
- Fold-specific spaces must hard-error in `get_aligned()`, `as_aligned_matrix()`, `alignment_quality()`, and `compose_alignment()`.
- Before stopping, run `scripts/verify-goal`. Finished only when it exits 0.
